orig_q:
Express the following in the form of \( a + bi \):
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \( \left( -5i \right) \left( \frac{1}{8} i \right) \)
    \item \( \left( -i \right) \left( 2i \right) \left( \frac{-1}{8} i \right)^3 \)
\end{enumerate}

pert_a:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \( \left( -5i \right) \left( \frac{1}{8} i \right) = \frac{-5}{8} i^2 = \frac{5}{8} + i0 \)
    \item \( \left( -i \right) \left( 2i \right) \left( \frac{-1}{8} i \right)^3 = 2 \times \frac{1}{256} \times i^5 = \frac{1}{256} i \)
\end{enumerate}

